# Antigravity Rules — GST-SOFTWARE Official Starter Next.js

1. TypeScript strict mode must be preserved at all times (`"strict": true`). No `any` types allowed.
2. Architecture: Domain-driven modular structure inside `src/modules/`.
3. Validations: Zod schemas for form inputs and external data.
4. Database: Supabase client in `src/lib/supabase/`. All database queries must enforce Row Level Security (RLS).
5. Styling: Tailwind CSS and Lucide React icons exclusively.
6. Error Handling: All async operations must handle errors and provide user feedback.
